        "content": "Typically, they  run  on  multiple  systems,  sometimes  configured  in  a  client-server  architecture  with  distributed  functionality.",
        "img_id": null
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text",
        "content": "Software performs not only the primary functions that the user needs, but also network control, security, user-interface presentation and processing, and data or object management.",
        "img_id": null
      },
