        ],
        "type": null
    },
    {
        "role": "bullet",
        "segment": "Egoless reviews are necessary to keep everyone aligned toward the same goal and to avoid personal attribution of faults, which can hinder open discussion and effective problem solving.",
        "citations": [
            {
                "type": "source_text",
                "content": "Thus, the review is valuable in emphasizing to all concerned that we are working toward the same goal.",
                "img_id": null
