  {
    "role": "paragraph",
    "segment": "The underlying cause of the Therac-25 problems was identified as a timing error that was difficult to reproduce; multiple analyses (fault-tree, code inspections) and external review were used to address hazards and guide improvements.",
    "citations": [
      {
        "type": "source_text",
        "content": "The underlying cause of the problems was a timing error that was difficult to reproduce.",
        "img_id": null
